# Wish Upon a Star (bastok 64): Enu's test with the weather NONE, which Bastok Markets' table never rolls (every day's
# three weathers are 1 or more, and a city has no fog): a GM's setWeather (`weather 0`) sets it. Accepted by GM with a
# Fallen Star. 12:00 (DAY) with NONE: 337 (the not-night side); 02:00 (MIDNIGHT, the isNight test's second side) with
# NONE: 334, completed (four Bags of Cactus Stems, fame +50, the star taken). The zone's weather timer does not reroll
# the GM's weather here: no tick reaches its next roll (`wait` moves only the Vana'diel clock).
lists BastokMarkets/Enu/onTrade BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/334
char zone=BastokMarkets pos=-253.7,-13,-92.3 lvl=30
quest Bastok.WishUponAStar accepted
item FallenStar
login
weather 0                      # GM: the weather NONE
trade Enu FallenStar x1        # 12:00, DAY, NONE: not night: 337
finish                         # 337 has no finish handler: the star kept
wait vana=14                   # 02:00: MIDNIGHT
trade Enu FallenStar x1        # MIDNIGHT, NONE: 334
finish                         # completed: four Bags of Cactus Stems, fame +50, the star taken
